Z||000000||saleenfiero||05-03-2001||10:56 AM||||I seen those wheel lights you can get.  The ones that go on your tire valve and glow while your wheels spin on your car, thought they glowed kind of cool.  Is this pushing it?  Anybody seen these things in person?  I realize they are probably very easily stolen.||||reg||4
Z||000001||FieroLisa||05-03-2001||11:15 AM||||Well if you like it, get it!!<P>Personally I really like them, but they are right now an unnecessary expense for me, and you're probably right that they would get stolen. Course since I don't drive my car except to shows, I just keep all those stealable things (sub box, radio face) in the house while the car is parked.<P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 violet pearl 4 speed GT- 17 in. rims, lowered, cold-air,<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><P><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A>||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fierodave2001||05-03-2001||11:19 AM||||I've seen those, but not up close.<P>Have you seen the latest in wheels yet?<P>They have a "spinning" part of the rim, that when you stop, it keeps spinning from the centrifugal force. The whole "face" spins when you're at a light, it looks like the car is still moving.<P>I sounds so "JC Whitney", but the ones I saw on TV were pretty neat looking.  <P>I think the show said they were like 2 grand or so.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Tweek||05-03-2001||11:36 AM||||what would be cooler is if the spinning part was weighted down so that when you were driving it would look as though the wheels were not turning.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Philphine||05-03-2001||11:40 AM||||because i have a lot of space bettween my spokes (3 stars) i put 3m reflectve tape in a band that runs behind the spokes (saw some wheels that are made that way). looks neat when light hits it. since i'm the sole driver i don't get to see it moving but everyone whos commented on noticing it likes it. i have painted silver wheels on my fiero but i just put a chrome set on my chevy (trying to put the same style wheel and tape on every thing, sort of like a signature) with the tape and the effect comes through even better. polished aluminum falls somewhere in bettween. ||||reg||1
