Z||000012||StuGood||05-03-2001||07:16 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by LZeitgeist:<BR><B>If you're driving at the speed of light, and you turn your headlights on, what happens?</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Nothing.  Now, if you go <B>faster</B> than the speed of light, it charges up your battery.  <P>But it only works that way in the daytime.  It's called the photo "ramcharging" effect.<P>...and then I woke up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">!  ||||reg||12
